      "title": "Main Lesson &mdash; Leigh Ryswyk",
      "notes": "Transition to the main lesson. Say: Now we listen to a news interview with Australia's first openly gay AFL player."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "welcome-afl",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:47px;margin-bottom:18px\">Welcome to Australian football</h2><div style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe width=\"880\" height=\"495\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7AjcFfBvIcs?start=864\" title=\"Welcome to Australian football\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>",
      "notes": "Play the clip from 14:24. It introduces Australian rules football (AFL) — the sport Leigh Ryswyk played. Students watch for context before the interview."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "gist-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:47px;margin-bottom:14px\">Listen 1 &mdash; The big idea</h2><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:36px;justify-content:center\"><div style=\"flex:1;max-width:560px\"><p style=\"color:#fff;font-size:38px;margin:0 0 8px 0\">Watch the video once. Don't write anything.</p><p style=\"color:#fff;font-size:38px;margin:0 0 10px 0\">The video is mainly about&hellip;</p><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;font-size:36px\">A</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;color:#fff;font-size:36px\">How to become a professional AFL player.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;font-size:36px\">B</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;color:#fff;font-size:36px\">The first openly gay AFL player and his decision to come out.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;font-size:36px\">C</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;color:#fff;font-size:36px\">How Australian rules football began.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;font-size:36px\">D</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;color:#fff;font-size:36px\">Famous AFL players from the past.</td></tr></table></div><div style=\"flex:1;max-width:600px;text-align:center\"><iframe width=\"600\" height=\"338\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/JzljTlTSzYk\" title=\"BTN interview\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>",
      "notes": "Play the BTN video once. Students listen for gist only and choose the main idea. Answer: B."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "gist-answer",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Gist — Answer",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">B &mdash; The first openly gay AFL player and his decision to come out.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Why</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">Leigh Ryswyk talks about his football career and why he decided to come out publicly.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Confirm B. The interview is about Leigh Ryswyk's decision to come out as the first openly gay AFL player."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "detail-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:47px;margin-bottom:14px\">Listen 2 &mdash; Answer the Questions</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:38px;margin:0 0 20px 0\">Watch again. Answer the six questions on your worksheet.</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe width=\"880\" height=\"495\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/JzljTlTSzYk\" title=\"BTN interview\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>",
      "notes": "Play the video again. Students answer the six open questions on the worksheet in their own words."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "detail-answers-1",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "body": "<style>.da{border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px auto;max-width:900px;width:100%}.da td{padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:34px;vertical-align:top}.da .num{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;min-width:30px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:47px;margin-bottom:8px\">Questions — Model Answers (1-3)</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span class=\"box-word\">Check</span> your answers.</p><table class=\"da\"><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">1</td><td>It was a turning point because he realised he could play well — he was best on ground for the opposition.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">2</td><td>He wanted to take the pressure off other people who were afraid — someone had to be the first.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">3</td><td>It suggests he was hiding a heavy weight and could finally be himself after coming out.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Model answers 1-3. Accept reasonable paraphrases. Click to reveal each answer."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "detail-answers-2",
